<title>FINLAND: Finnish June jobless rate fell to 15.0 pct - SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish June jobless rate fell to 15.0 pct - SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish unemployment rate fell to 15.0 percent in June from 16.7 percent in May, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>			June 1997	May 1997     June 1996</p>
<p> Unemployed	   408,000	 438,000	 439,000</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)  15.0	    16.7	    16.4</p>
<p>The figures are not seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>Finland's labour ministry, calculating on a different basis, earlier said the June unemployment rate rose to 16.5 percent from 15.5 percent in May.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
